---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import client from '../data/client.json';
---
<Base title={`Accessibility Statement | ${client.name}`} description={`${client.name} builds this website to WCAG 2.1 AA and welcomes feedback about anything that is hard to use.`} path="/accessibility">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
    <p class="muted">Draft. Confirm the reply time, add the last-tested date and a public contact address before launch.</p>
    <p>This site is built to WCAG 2.1 level AA and checked with automated tools. Hands-on testing with a keyboard and screen readers is still to be done. Some content may still have problems.</p>
    <h2>The 3D views</h2>
    <p>The 3D frame and the layer view are extras. Everything they show is also written in text on the page. You can turn the 3D frame with the mouse, with touch, or with the arrow keys. Automatic rotation can be paused, and it is off if your device asks for reduced motion.</p>
    <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
    <p>If anything on this site is hard to use, send us a note through the <a href="/#installer">request form</a> and say what happened. We aim to reply within three business days.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
